<title>DUBAI: Quake shakes southern Iranian city.</title>
<headline>Quake shakes southern Iranian city.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A minor earthquake measuring 3.6 on the Richter scale hit the southern Iranian city of Larestan late on Friday, the official Iranian news agency IRNA reported on Saturday.</p>
<p>IRNA said no casualties or damage to property had been reported.</p>
<p>Earthquakes hit Iran regularly. An earthquake measuring 4.8 damaged houses in southern Iran in April but there were no reports of casualties.</p>
